  "p2748c401": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p> <p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p> <p>1. Click Orders-&gt;<strong>Order Transaction</strong></p> <p>2. Select Customer</p> <p>3. <strong>Search</strong> Item-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>...repeat the process until all items entered</p> <p>4. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>5. Input <strong>DownPayment </strong>-&gt;Press Enter / Click Save</p>  <p>6. Click Sales-&gt;<strong>Sales Transaction</strong></p> <p>7. Right Click Empty Space at the second tab</p> <p>8. Click Load S.O. button</p> <p>9. DoubleClick selected Sales Order record</p> <p>10. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>11. Change Pickup dropdown to Deliver</p> <p>12. Select PaymentType</p> <p>13. Click Save</p>  <p>14. Click Delivery-&gt;<strong>Delivery Transaction</strong></p> <p>15. Click Go</p> <p>16. Select Receipt</p> <p>17. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>18. Fill in Remarks</p> <p>19. Click Save</p> <p>",
