  "p34289ef4": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Files-&gt;<strong>Printers</strong></p> <p>2. Click <strong>New</strong> button</p> <p>3. Locate PrinterName</p> <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;In the Windows taskbar, search for <strong>Printers &amp; Scanners</strong> and open it.</p> <p> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Browse through the list of printers connected to your network and select the one you want to add.</p> <p>4. Fill in the Printer Details</p> <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Area - Enter the location of the printer (e.g., \"Office 1\" or \"Reception\"). </p> <p> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;PrinterName - Enter the exact name of the printer as listed in your computer. </p> <p>5. Click <strong>Save</strong></p>",
