  "p566ff164": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Returns-&gt;<strong>Sales Return Transaction</strong></p> <p>2.&nbsp;Search Customer</p> <p>3. Click Go</p> <p>4. Search Item-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>5. Input Quantity-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>6. Input Reason</p> <p>...repeat the process until all items&nbsp;are entered.</p> <p>...right click&nbsp;the&nbsp;item&nbsp;to add serialnos, edit/remove (second tab)</p> <p>7. Click Save-F4</p> <p>8. Select PaymentType</p> <p>9. Click Save</p>",
  "p56f47968": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p><strong>Click BIR-&gt;XZ Readings</strong></p>  <p><strong>Generate Z Reading</strong></p> <p>1. Select Z-Reading tab</p> <p>2. Select Terminal-&gt;Click Preview</p> <p>3. Click Generate</p>  <p><strong>Preview&nbsp;X Reading</strong></p> <p>1. Select X-Reading tab</p> <p>2. Select Terminal-&gt;Click Preview</p> <p>3. Click Preview-&gt;POS Print (optional)</p>",
  "p5707e441": "<p>1. <a data-page=\"page_199.html\">Business Info</a></p> <p>2. <a data-page=\"popups.htm\">Popups</a></p> <p>3. <a data-page=\"backup.htm\">Backup</a></p>",
  "p579c4139": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Expenses-&gt;Expense<strong> Transaction</strong></p> <p>2. <strong>Search</strong> Particular-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>3. Input <strong>Amount</strong>-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>...repeat the process until all&nbsp;particulars entered</p> <p>4. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>5. Select PaymentType</p> <p>6.<strong> </strong>Click Save</p>",
  "p58a803ad": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p> <p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p> <p>1. Click Expenses-&gt;<strong>Expense Transaction</strong></p> <p>2. <strong>Search</strong> Particular-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>3. Input Amount-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>...repeat the process until all particulars entered</p> <p>4. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>5. Select <strong>PaymentType Charge</strong></p> <p>6.<strong> </strong>Click Save</p>  <p>7. Click Payables-&gt;<strong>Payee Transaction</strong></p> <p>8. Select Payee</p> <p>9. Right Click Record-&gt;<strong>Click Add</strong></p> <p>10. Select PaymentType&nbsp;</p> <p>11. Click Save</p>",
