  "p5b7a16b7": "<p><strong>Click Disbursements-&gt;Disbursed Checks</strong></p> <ul> <ul> <li>Select Filter Criteria-&gt;Click Go&nbsp;- to view disbursed checks <li>Print - to print&nbsp;disbursed checks <li>Search - to search&nbsp;disbursed&nbsp;check <li>Print Receipt - to print selected receipt</li></ul></ul>",
