  "p5de71da3": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Inventory-&gt;Inventory Stocks</p> <p>2. At the second tab-&gt;Select Category-&gt;View Stocks <p>3. Click New Inventory-&gt;Click confirmation-&gt;Yes (the selected category transferred to the 1st tab) <p>4. At the first tab-&gt;Select Category-&gt;Click View <p>5. Print Stocks (pls goto the ceiling area to&nbsp;physically count the item and record it under physical count column) <p>6. Using the printed copy, type&nbsp;under&nbsp;physical account&nbsp;column and press enter. <p>7. Once all the physical count&nbsp;were inputted, click Add to Finish.",
