  "pb61b5c6b": "<p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; Click Accounting-&gt;Account Titles</strong></p> <ul> <ul> <li>View - to view&nbsp;account titles&nbsp; <li>New - to add new account title</li> <ul> <li>Input AccountType and Account Title-&gt;Click Save</li></ul> <li>Print - to print account titles <li>Search&nbsp;- to search account title</li> <ul> <li>RightClick to edit/delete account title</li></ul></ul></ul>",
