  "pb77e8afd": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Receiving-&gt;<strong>Receiving Transaction</strong></p> <p>2. <strong>Search</strong> Item-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>3. Input Quantity-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>...repeat the process until all items entered</p> <p>4. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>5. Select <strong>PaymentType Charge</strong></p> <p>6.<strong> </strong>Click Save</p>  <p>7. Click Payables-&gt;<strong>Payee Transaction</strong></p> <p>8. <strong>Select</strong> Payee</p> <p>9. Right Click Record-&gt;<strong>Click Add</strong></p> <p>10. Select PaymentType&nbsp;</p> <p>11. Click Save</p>",
  "pb7eb17b6": "<strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Click Returns-&gt;Sales Return Reports</strong> <ul> <ul> <li>Select Filter Criteria-&gt;Click Go</li></ul></ul>",
  "pb8bfc973": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Open the system address in the browser (computer, tablet or phone).</p> <p>2. Select <strong>Branch</strong> (or <strong>Super Admin</strong>).</p> <p>3. Input <strong>Username</strong> and <strong>Password</strong> (tick <strong>Show password</strong> to see what you type).</p> <p>4. Select <strong>Edition</strong> (hosted system only). <strong>DEFAULT</strong> uses the edition of your user account.</p> <p>5. Tick <strong>Remember me</strong> to keep the branch, edition and username on this device. The password is never kept.</p> <p>6. Click <strong>Login</strong>.</p>  <p>After login the <strong>Dashboard</strong> is shown. On a phone the system opens straight on the Login screen.</p>",
  "pb90e287f": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Receivables-&gt;Receivables Report</p> <p>2.&nbsp;Select Filter Criteria-&gt;Click Go&nbsp;",
