  "pbe47b450": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p>  <p>1. Click Sales-&gt;<strong>Sales Transaction</strong></p> <p>2. <strong>Search</strong> Item-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>...repeat the process until all items entered</p> <p>3. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>4. Select <strong>PaymentType Charge</strong></p> <p>5.<strong> </strong>Click Save</p>  <p>6. Click Receivables-&gt;<strong>Payment Transaction</strong></p> <p>7. <strong>Select</strong> Customer</p> <p>8. Right Click Record-&gt;<strong>Click Add</strong></p> <p>9. Input AmountPaid-&gt;Press Enter / Click Save</p>",
