  "pd44cd523": "<strong></strong>&nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Click Vouchering-&gt;Voucher Records</strong> <p> <ul> <ul> <li>Select DateRange-&gt;Click Go - to view&nbsp;voucher&nbsp;transactions <li>Print - to print&nbsp;voucher receipts <li>Search - to search receipt </li> <ul> <li>RightClick&nbsp;selected record to edit/void receipt <li>Print Receipt - to print a selected receipt</li></ul></ul></ul>",
