  "pedbc29ef": "<p><strong>Easy Steps:</strong></p> <p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p> <p>1. Click Purchasing-&gt;<strong>PO Transaction</strong></p> <p>2. Select Supplier</p> <p>3. <strong>Search</strong> Item-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>4. Input Quantity-&gt;Press Enter</p> <p>...repeat the process until all items entered</p> <p>5. Click <strong>Save-F4</strong></p> <p>6.&nbsp;Select PaymentType</p> <p>7. Check Request Voucher</p> <p>8. Click Save</p>  <p>9. Click Vouchering-&gt;<strong>Voucher Requests</strong></p> <p>10. Click View Requests</p> <p>11. Select Receipt</p> <p>12. Click Action-&gt;Generate Voucher</p> <p>13. Select PaymentType</p> <p>14. Input Amount</p> <p>15. Input Requested By</p> <p>16. Click Save</p>  <p>17. Click Disbursement-&gt;<strong>Disbursement Requests</strong></p> <p>18. Click View Requests</p> <p>19. Select Receipt</p> <p>20. Click Action-&gt;Generate Disbursement</p> <p>21. Select PaymentType</p> <p>22. Select CashAccount</p> <p>23. Input Received By</p> <p>24. Click Save</p> <p>",
